WEBVTT

00:03:59.265 --> 00:04:02.209
The workers still come
the next day, they do their job,

00:04:02.233 --> 00:04:04.796
but they're following
different instructions.

00:04:05.524 --> 00:04:09.277
So replacing the bacteria
DNA with virus DNA

00:04:09.301 --> 00:04:14.123
turns the bacteria into a factory
for making viruses --

00:04:14.147 --> 00:04:17.901
that is, until it's so filled
with viruses that it bursts.

00:04:18.896 --> 00:04:22.276
But that's not the only way
that viruses infect bacteria.

00:04:22.825 --> 00:04:26.283
Some are much more crafty.

00:04:26.307 --> 00:04:27.457
(Laughter)

00:04:28.991 --> 00:04:33.776
When a secret agent virus
infects a bacterium,